   "modified": "2026-10-27T00:00:00Z",
   "title": "REQ - Extend the benchmark to ligands, multiple chains and partially occupied fragments",
   "description": {
    "@type": "Item",
    "format": "text/plain",
    "content": "Named as a high-priority future direction. Needs a way to handle compositional as well as conformational heterogeneity."
   },
